<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Leong Hup posts 6-mth net loss.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Leong Hup posts 6-mth net loss.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Sept 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss		     5.26     vs  profit  5.11</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents) loss   5.8	vs  profit  5.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		   186.12     vs	  164.09</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss		 3.35     vs  profit  9.10</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less   0.54     vs  less    0.53</p>
<p>NOTE - Leong Hup Holdings Bhd is mainly involved in chicken breeding.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
